; tiles.xon -- the classic set drawn, for a windowed front-end: the
; Sunken Vault, an old underground of grey dressed stone, damp and long
; used.  Torchlight in iron brackets, worn flags, beaten-earth passages;
; straw, bones and spent torches where the last ones left them.
;
; Read by the graphical front-end only: the set itself is the .xon files
; one directory up, and this directory is not one of them.  The form is
; as data/delve/art/tiles.xon gives it.

(size 16 16)

(colour "." 0 0 0 0)
(colour "k" 14 13 14)
